%% First sign-in with the teacher's code, then signing in again with code plus PIN.
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kids web app
    participant A as Kids API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    K->>A: POST /api/auth/redeem {code}
    A->>D: code is issued and not expired, create child and plant, mark code redeemed
    A-->>K: session cookie, ask the kid to choose a PIN
    K->>A: POST /api/auth/pin {pin}
    A->>D: store the PIN hash
    Note over K,A: Later, on a cleared or new browser
    K->>A: POST /api/auth/sign-in {code, pin}
    A->>D: compare PIN hash, count failures, lock after 5
    A-->>K: new session cookie, or "ask your teacher for a new code"
